Fonts in this directory
----------------------

LiberationSerif-Regular.ttf and LiberationSerif-Bold.ttf are the
Liberation Serif fonts, licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1 (https://scripts.sil.org/OFL). They are vendored here so
the program renders identically in any environment, including the
make.fun sandbox, without relying on system-installed fonts.
